# Justified exceptions to the no-swallowed-errors rule.
#
# Format, pipe separated, three fields:
#   <repo relative path> | <fixed string that must appear in the line> | <reason>
#
# A reason is required. An entry that matches nothing fails the test, so this
# file cannot accumulate dead exceptions.
#
# There are no entries. Every construct that hides a failure has been removed
# rather than excepted. Add one here only with a reason that says why the
# failure it hides is not a failure.
